---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { AppConfig } from '@/utils/AppConfig';
const { title } = AppConfig;
const { description } = AppConfig;
import Section from '../../components/Section.astro';
---

<Base head={{ title, description }}>
	<Section>
		<slot />
		<br />

		<p class="pb-2 pt-6 text-4xl font-bold">PROJECTS</p>
		<div class="flex justify-center py-4">
			<img
				src="/project_img.png"
				alt="Image"
				class="shadow-lg"
				style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;"
			/>
		</div>
		<section class="text-sm">
			<p class="py-1 text-3xl font-bold">
				<span class="text-6xl">1.</span>
				<a
					href="https://github.com/ansh0eman/SetuAI"
					target="_blank"
					class="text-inherit underline hover:text-blue-500"
				>
					SetuAI : AI-Powered Compliance Engine
				</a>
			</p>
			<p class="py-2">
				• <strong>SetuAI</strong> is an AI-powered compliance engine designed for <strong
					>India’s textile supply chain</strong
				>. It helps textile vendors become <em>“audit-ready”</em> by automating the verification of mandatory
				compliance certificates using <strong>OCR</strong> (Optical Character Recognition) and AI, alongside
				live checks with government APIs. <br /><br />
				• This makes compliance easier, faster, and more reliable for vendors (especially small ones)
				and promotes
				<strong>ethical sourcing</strong> for big enterprise buyers. <br /><br />
				• Built a full-stack SaaS platform integrating <strong>PostgreSQL</strong>, <strong
					>Node.js</strong
				>, <strong>React</strong>, and <strong>Google Gemini OCR</strong>
				to power compliance verification. <br /><br />
				• Incorporated live government API checks, role-based dashboards, and risk scoring — reducing
				vendor onboarding time by <strong>70%</strong>. <br /><br />
				• Awarded a <strong>special recognition at SAP Hackfest’25</strong> for innovation and real-world
				impact.
			</p>

			<p class="py-1 text-3xl font-bold">
				<span class="text-6xl">2.</span>
				<a
					href="/posts/second_blog_post"
					target="_blank"
					class="text-inherit underline hover:text-blue-500"
				>
					Art Generation with Neural Style Transfer Model
				</a>
			</p>
			<p class="py-2">
				• Developed a Deep Learning Model using NST to generate aesthetically pleasing and
				contextually significant images in the style of various Impressionism movement artists. <br
				/><br />
				• Used convolutional neural networks (CNNs), a 19-layer VGG network pre-trained on the ImageNet
				database, to recognize and apply low-level and high-level features in the style transfer process.
				<br /><br />
				• Enhanced skills in researching and implementing advanced deep learning algorithms while exploring
				the art history of Impressionism.
			</p>

			<p class="py-1 text-3xl font-bold">
				<span class="text-6xl">3.</span>
				<a
					href="https://github.com/ansh0eman/Fractal-Nature-of-Lyrical-Verses"
					target="_blank"
					class="text-inherit underline hover:text-blue-500"
				>
					Analysis of Fractal-Nature of Lyrical Verses
				</a>
			</p>
			<p class="py-2">
				• Created a model to analyze and visualize the fractal nature of lyrical verses and generate
				lyrics using advanced NLP techniques and transformer models. <br /><br />
				• Applied word embeddings (Word2Vec, Doc2Vec, BERT) and fine-tuned transformer models (GPT-3,
				Hugging Face Transformers) for lyrics generation focused on specific artists. <br /><br />
				• Visualized complex lyrical patterns using Python libraries such as NLTK, Matplotlib, and Plotly.
			</p>

			<p class="py-1 text-3xl font-bold">
				<span class="text-6xl">4.</span>
				<a
					href="https://github.com/ansh0eman/ImageFX"
					target="_blank"
					class="text-inherit underline hover:text-blue-500"
				>
					ImageFX : Image Processing Application
				</a>
			</p>
			<p class="py-2">
				• Developed an image processing application with various filters, histogram-based analysis,
				and image compression features. <br /><br />
				• Utilized Object-Oriented Programming principles (inheritance, modularity) with JavaFX and CSS
				styling to design an intuitive GUI for image editing and analysis.
			</p>

			<p class="py-1 text-3xl font-bold">
				<span class="text-6xl">5.</span>
				<a
					href="https://github.com/ansh0eman/Property-Management-System"
					target="_blank"
					class="text-inherit underline hover:text-blue-500"
				>
					Property Management System
				</a>
			</p>
			<p class="py-2">
				• Designed a Python and SQL-based application for managing tenants, leases, and maintenance
				requests. <br /><br />
				• Integrated secure storage for property-related documents and an easy-to-navigate command-line
				interface with Rich library. <br /><br />
				• Focused on scalability and reliability to handle real-world property management workflows.
			</p>

			<p class="py-2">
				<strong>Contact me:</strong>
				<a href="mailto:anshuwont@gmail.com" class="text-blue-500 hover:underline"
					>anshuwont@gmail.com</a
				>
			</p>
		</section>
	</Section>
</Base>
